  "id": "disney_tunnels",
  "lang": "en",
  "title": "Disney's secret *underground* city 🏰",
  "pronounce": {},
  "aspect": "1:1",
  "gap": 0.05,
  "hook": {
    "lines": [
      "Under Disney's Magic Kingdom,",
      "there's a *secret* city."
    ],
    "clips": [
      "d_castle",
      "d_tunnel"
    ],
    "annotate": [
      {
        "type": "arrow",
        "at": "line2",
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.5,
        "angle": 30
      }
    ],
    "sfx": [
      {
        "id": "boom",
        "at": "word:secret"
      }
    ]
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "lines": [
        "Nine acres of tunnels",
        "called *utilidors*."
      ],
      "clip": "d_map"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Cast members use them to cross the park",
        "without ever being *seen*."
      ],
      "clip": "d_mickey",
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "ooh",
          "at": "end",
          "gain": -4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Legend says Walt hated seeing a *cowboy*",
        "walking through Tomorrowland…"
      ],
      "clip": "d_street"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "…so in Florida,",
        "everything was hidden *below*."
      ],
      "clip": "d_carts"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Costumes, food, trash, deliveries —",
        "all moving *underneath* you."
      ],
      "clip": "d_costume"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "But here's the *twist*…"
      ],
      "clip": "d_corridor",
      "pause_after": 0.3,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "dun_dun",
          "at": "start",
          "gain": -5,
          "dur": 2.0
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "the tunnels aren't *underground*."
      ],
      "clip": "d_castle2",
      "punch": true,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "boom",
          "at": "word:underground"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Florida's water table",
        "was too high to dig."
      ],
      "clip": "d_build"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "So they built the tunnels",
        "at *ground level*…"
      ],
      "clip": "d_build2"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "…and piled the whole park on *top*."
      ],
      "clip": "d_street2"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "You're actually walking",
        "on the *second floor*."
      ],
      "clip": "d_castle3",
      "punch": true,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "how_possible",
          "at": "end+0.05",
          "gain": -3
        }
      ],
      "pause_after": 1.2
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Did *you* know that? 😳"
      ],
      "clip": "d_castle4"
    }
  ],
